#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0533 expect=noViolation domain=DM
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when the Planned Repro Path Code (RPATHCD) variable is present in the Demographics (DM) dataset; RPATHCD is not used in human clinical trials.
#note "The RPATHCD column is absent from DM, so the rule does not fire"
dataset DM label=Demographics
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1015
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1023
---
